fix_message:
Support Copy-and-Update for Array with Range (#940)

This change adds full support for copy-update and assign-update using
ranges. With this fix, patterns like the following are now correctly
supported:
```qsharp
[0, 1, 2] w/ 1..2 <- [10, 11]
// yields [0, 10, 11]

[0, 1, 2, 3] w/ ...2... <- [10, 11]
// yields [10, 1, 11, 3]

mutable x = [1, 2, 3, 4];
set x w/= 2..-1..0 <- [10, 11];
// x updated in-place to [1, 11, 10, 4]
```

Fixes #933

